1
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:56,600
Get lost.

2
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:03,920
Mr. Zhao.

3
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,359
Have some water.

4
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,200
Qianqian.

5
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,640
You had a rough time just now.

6
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,359
That woman Shen Jialing,

7
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:27,280
throwing Yunding Group's weight around,

8
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,560
has a terrible temper.

9
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:30,920
Don't take it to heart.

10
00:01:35,359 --> 00:01:36,719
Here's a card.

11
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,599
Go spend it.

12
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,400
Buy a bag you like

13
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,799
and cheer yourself up.

14
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,680
Mr. Zhao.

15
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,359
I don't want a bag.

16
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:49,439
Tonight,

17
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,879
Shen Jialing called me PR eye candy.

18
00:01:52,319 --> 00:01:53,200
She slapped me in the face,

19
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,159
but you must mind the master

20
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,640
before beating the dog.

21
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,400
In her eyes,

22
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,319
she has zero respect for you.

23
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,239
Yunding's empire is just too massive.

24
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,159
When you're under someone's roof,

25
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,520
you have no choice but to bow.

26
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,479
What does a woman know anyway?

27
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:14,879
I may not get the big picture,

28
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:17,680
but

29
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,159
I understand you.

30
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,080
Mr. Zhao,

31
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,280
among the people around you,

32
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:26,800
how many can actually help you?

33
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,000
Every single one of them

34
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,879
is just freeloading off you.

35
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:33,319
Instead of pinning your hopes on them,

36
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:35,479
why not leave it to me?

37
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:37,240
I don't want an empty deputy manager role.

38
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,479
I want real authority.

39
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:41,400
I'll make sure Yunding Group

40
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,599
partners with us again.

41
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,520
Impressive, little girl.

42
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:52,759
Getting insulted like that

43
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,479
actually stirred up your ambition.

44
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,439
You want a seat at the main table, huh?

45
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,240
Fine.

46
00:03:10,879 --> 00:03:12,159
Then show me

47
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,560
what you're made of.

48
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,960
Can't take the heat already?

49
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,240
The door isn't locked.

50
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,000
You can leave right now.

51
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,560
I won't be a disposable bargaining chip.

52
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,360
I, Zhou Qian,

53
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,879
can also be like Shen Jialing—

54
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,479
at the card table,

55
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:45,400
a woman who calls the shots.

56
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:15,479
Have a seat.

57
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:17,000
Thank you, Second Master.

58
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,120
Second Master,

59
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:20,839
you're staying for good this time, right?

60
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,040
For Yunding Group, this is absolutely

61
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,879
a great blessing.

62
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,439
Under your leadership,

63
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:31,600
Yunding Group will surely grow even stronger.

64
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,720
Cut the flattery.

65
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,519
Ever since my eldest nephew passed,

66
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,600
and Yunding was handed to Jialing,

67
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,959
what she's achieved on her own

68
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,199
is already quite impressive.

69
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,319
I won't meddle in Group affairs anymore.

70
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,720
You came to see me today

71
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,879
about Yunding ending our partnership, right?

72
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:47,959
What?

73
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,839
Here to demand an explanation from me?

74
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,319
No, no, no!

75
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,199
Second Master,

76
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:55,639
even if I had ten times the nerve,

77
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:57,839
I wouldn't dare demand anything from you.

78
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,040
Truth is,

79
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:03,360
I only have my clumsy mouth to blame

80
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:06,279
for offending Chairwoman Shen's favorite.

81
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,319
I only came today

82
00:05:08,319 --> 00:05:09,600
because

83
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:13,000
I really couldn't bear to watch

84
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:13,959
Yunding Group, which Old Master Xu

85
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:16,519
and you built together,

86
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,920
get hollowed out

87
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,160
by some dirty little hoodlum!

88
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:21,560
What do you mean?

89
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:22,720
Speak plainly.

90
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:27,560
Second Master,

91
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,160
take a look at these photos.

92
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,079
These photos

93
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:33,399
were taken just a few days ago

94
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:35,480
in Yunding Group's first-floor lobby.

95
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:36,759
Who is this punk?

96
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:37,879
According to reliable sources,

97
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:40,199
he used to be nothing more

98
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:42,199
than an idle street thug.

99
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:44,000
Then, God knows how,

100
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:47,160
he bedded Jinhua Garment Factory's deputy.

101
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:48,959
He even ended up becoming

102
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,800
a shareholder of Jinhua Garment Factory!

103
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:51,759
After that,

104
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,720
he got some demolition money

105
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,199
and went around playing the big shot.

106
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:58,199
Somehow, he even fooled Chairwoman Shen.

107
00:05:59,199 --> 00:06:00,959
Our company's project manager

108
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:02,199
handling the Yunding partnership

109
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,759
is his ex-girlfriend.

110
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,279
Chairwoman Shen,

111
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:07,920
purely because of this connection,

112
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,519
terminated our partnership.

113
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,560
You're saying

114
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:16,839
she's not only keeping a boy toy,

115
00:06:17,839 --> 00:06:20,439
but abusing her power to clear his way?

116
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,839
Precisely!

117
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:23,839
Second Master,

118
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,240
please don't be angry.

119
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,959
Chairwoman Shen is still young, after all.

120
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,560
Falling for the sweet talk

121
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,519
of a gigolo like him...

122
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,240
It's somewhat understandable.

123
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:35,000
It's just that Yunding Group

124
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:37,399
is the Xu family's foundation in China.

125
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,000
How could we let a

126
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,639
freeloading punk

127
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,120
call the shots there?

128
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,759
Still, we can't blame Jialing

129
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:47,240
based on just a few photos.

130
00:06:48,519 --> 00:06:49,360
Catch a thief with the loot,

131
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,519
catch lovers in the act.

132
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:51,759
A-Xi.

133
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,279
Have someone look into this kid.

134
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,560
Don't alert Jialing.

135
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,319
Yes, sir.

136
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,879
Shen Jialing...

137
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,680
Those Yunding projects...

138
00:06:59,040 --> 00:06:59,480
I, Zhao Gang,

139
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,680
will take them all back with interest,

140
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:03,560
and I'll stomp all over your face

141
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,959
to watch you be destroyed!

142
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,839
If this turns out to be true,

143
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,079
then Shen Jialing

144
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,920
has truly held that position for too long

145
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,120
and forgotten her place.

146
00:07:12,199 --> 00:07:13,959
And that kid from Jinhua Garment Factory...

147
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,360
He's got some nerve.

148
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:18,560
Daring to poach from my Xu family.

149
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,399
Second Master,

150
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,399
I've looked into it.

151
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:30,360
The new project Yunding just invested in

152
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,120
is this garment factory.

153
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,279
What's more,

154
00:07:34,279 --> 00:07:35,600
when it entered Yunding Department Store,

155
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:37,040
Chairwoman Shen

156
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,120
made a rare exception to green-light them,

157
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,319
fast-tracking the whole process.

158
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:43,920
I'd like to see what's so fishy here

159
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:46,199
that made her go to such great lengths.

160
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,279
Excuse me, sir.

161
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,000
Who are you looking for?

162
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,160
Where is the director's office, please?

163
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,279
The director's office?

164
00:07:57,279 --> 00:07:57,920
It's on the second floor.

165
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,040
Thank you.

166
00:07:59,040 --> 00:07:59,519
The director is in.

167
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:00,600
Great, thank you.

168
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,519
Dawei,

169
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:12,439
why did you get into that...

170
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,360
massive appliance warehouse outlet?

171
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:17,079
That's a hundred-million black hole!

172
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,040
Uncle Dong,

173
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:20,399
the boom in apparel

174
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,720
will only last three years.

175
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:23,160
Who is this kid?

176
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:25,279
That's what I've been worried about.

177
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,399
You only see the store's foot traffic now,

178
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,439
but let me tell you,

179
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:31,040
the traditional department store model

180
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:34,200
is about to become a cutthroat red ocean.

181
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,080
People are getting wealthier now.

182
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,720
Once basic needs are met,

183
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,440
what's the next core consumption upgrade?

184
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:42,240
Major appliances.

185
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,200
Color TVs, fridges, and washing machines.

186
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,639
Over the next decade,

187
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:48,879
the domestic appliance sector will explode.

188
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,519
What we must do

189
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,240
isn't to stay in Yunding Department Store

190
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,559
and rent a stall to sell clothes,

191
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,279
but right next to Yunding Mall,

192
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:58,399
acquire the largest plot of land

193
00:08:58,399 --> 00:08:59,600
to build an independent,

194
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,480
mega appliance experience store.

195
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,759
But we can't beat those foreign brands!

196
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:07,200
Who said we're competing with them?

197
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,879
The public's growing material demands

198
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:12,000
can't be met by domestic output right now.

199
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:13,600
What we need to do

200
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,080
is build the nation's largest

201
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,279
distribution hub for imported appliances.

202
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:18,399
Take all those...

203
00:09:18,799 --> 00:09:19,480
So-whatever,

204
00:09:19,799 --> 00:09:20,639
Pana-something,

205
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:21,799
Sie-whatever...

206
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,519
Bring all these mature brands

207
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:25,480
straight into our own venue.

208
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:26,600
Up front,

209
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,240
we'll take their agency fees and traffic,

210
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,320
and use the bustling retail channels

211
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:33,120
to nurture our own domestic brands.

212
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,200
That's pitting foreign against foreign.

213
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:37,279
In the end, we fully complete

214
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:38,799
the buildout of the appliance complex.

215
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:41,320
Pitting foreign against foreign! Genius!

216
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,639
In my 20-plus years in business,

217
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:47,799
I never thought I'd hear from a young man

218
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:49,799
an open strategy bold enough to upend the

219
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,480
business landscape for the next decade.

220
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,399
And you are...?
